Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(dhv-ts):=20SelfParam=20=E6=97=A0=20&=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E5=89=8D=E7=BC=80=E7=9A=84=20mut=20self=20=E8=AF=86=E5=88=AB?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20+=20native=20=E5=9D=97=E6=AD=A3=E5=88=99=E5=AD=97=E9=9D=A2?=
